{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-07-14 19:54:00', 'title': 'OMNICOM GROUP INC. DECLARES DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK , JULY 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF OMNICOM GROUP INC. (NYSE:\xa0OMC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF\xa070 CENTS\xa0PER OUTSTANDING SHARE OF THE CORPORATION'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON\xa0OCTOBER 12, 2022\xa0TO OMNICOM GROUP COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0SEPTEMBER 21, 2022."}{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-07-14 07:00:00', 'title': 'IN NEW INDEPENDENT RESEARCH, OMNICOM MEDIA GROUP RECEIVES HIGHEST POSSIBLE SCORES IN RETAIL MEDIA, COMMERCE MEDIA, AND INTELLIGENCE AND INSIGHTS CRITERIA', 'text': 'OMG NAMED A "LEADER" AMONG GLOBAL MEDIA AGENCY GROUPS NEW YORK , JULY 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN A NEW ANALYSIS OF GLOBAL MEDIA AGENCY GROUPS FROM LEADING RESEARCH AND ADVISORY FIRM FORRESTER, OMNICOM MEDIA GROUP (OMG), THE MEDIA SERVICES DIVISION OF OMNICOM GROUP INC. (NYSE: OMC) RECEIVED THE HIGHEST POSSIBLE SCORES IN THE RETAIL MEDIA, COMMERCE MEDIA, INTELLIGENCE AND INSIGHTS, AND OPTIMIZATION CRITERIA; AS WELL AS IN THE OPERATIONS AND INNOVATION ROADMAP CRITERIA. \xa0 THE FORRESTER WAVE™: GLOBAL MEDIA MANAGEMENT SERVICES ANALYZES THE SEVEN MOST SIGNIFICANT GLOBAL MEDIA MANAGEMENT SERVICE PROVIDERS AGAINST A 19-CRITERION EVALUATION ACROSS THREE CATEGORIES: CURRENT OFFERING, STRATEGY, AND MARKET PRESENCE.'}